graph TD
    %% Core Client & Infrastructure
    A[Mobile Device Browser] -->|Initial Request| B(GitHub Pages Hosting)
    B -->|Serves Static Files| A
    
    %% Offline Architecture (PWA)
    A -->|Installs| SW[sw.js - Service Worker]
    SW -->|Caches Assets on First Load| C_Cache[(Browser Cache)]
    C_Cache -->|Offline Fallback| A
    
    %% Application Logic (ES Modules)
    A -->|Entry Point| APP[app.js - Orchestrator]
    APP -->|Imports Variables| CFG(config.js)
    APP -->|Fetches Data| API[api.js]
    APP -->|Binds Events| UI[ui.js]
    APP -->|Initializes Map| MAP[map.js]
    
    %% Data Flow
    API -->|HTTP GET or Cache| JSON{places.json}
    JSON -->|Returns 73 Locations| MAP
    
    %% Map Rendering
    MAP -->|Demands Engine| L[Leaflet.js CDN]
    L -->|Fetches Map Tiles| OSM[OpenStreetMap Servers]
    OSM -->|Returns Tile Images| L
    CFG -->|Provides Colors & Icons| MAP
    MAP -->|Renders Custom Markers| A
    
    %% User Interactions
    UI -->|Toggles Checkbox| UI_Filter[Real-Time Category Filter]
    UI_Filter -->|Updates LayerGroup| MAP
    
    UI -->|Clicks FAB Bottom-Left| UI_Locate[Locate Me Button]
    UI_Locate -->|Geolocation API| MAP
    
    A -->|Taps Marker| L_Popup[Closes old Popup, Opens new Popup]
    L_Popup -->|Click 'Navigate'| GMAPS[Deep Link to Google Maps App]